NOTES
-----
- Data sources bound through the generated C# client (ADR-004) via the P1/S8 seam:
    useApiKeys      → get_api_v1_api_keys             (ApiKeysSource.StreamApiKeysAsync)
    useCreateApiKey → post_api_v1_api_keys            (ApiKeysSource.CreateAsync)
    useDeleteApiKey → delete_api_v1_api_keys_id       (ApiKeysSource.DeleteAsync)
    useRevokeApiKey → post_api_v1_api_keys_id_revoke  (ApiKeysSource.RevokeAsync)
  Read-model field names are SI/snake_case from internal/api/apikey/handler.go
  (id, key_prefix, permissions, created_at, last_used_at, expires_at); the create
  response carries the one-time "key".
- a11y: AutomationProperties names on the page, create action, permission/expired
  chips, the masked value reveal and the revoke/delete row actions; loading +
  empty/error are live regions (LiveRegion / TsFeedbackState). Light/dark + Mica
  honoured through the W2 design tokens (no hardcoded colours).
- No charts / no map for this unit (manifest declares 0 of each).
- No placeholders/stubs (ADR-011): check-placeholders csharp scan = 0.

